Maintainer: Bahadır Yüzbaşı <b.yzb@hotmail.com>
Description: Provides tools for Lorentz Hyperbolic Weighted Regression (LHWR), a local weighted regression framework on the Lorentz hyperboloid. Locality is defined through Lorentz-hyperboloid distances and can be applied to geographic coordinates, latent feature maps, similarity embeddings, network embeddings, functional data summaries, and shape-analysis scores. The package provides Lorentz geometry utilities, hyperbolic distance computation, kernel weighting, bandwidth selection by AICc or cross validation, local weighted regression fitting, diagnostics, plotting, and simulation helpers.
